abstract: "Preprint, not peer reviewed. Asks whether pressure moves people's choices away from their own reflective reference choices in a consistent direction, sets out a registered within-person test (H1) and five downstream tests, and revises the Coherence-Weighted Human Feedback (CWHF) proposal. Supersedes the claims of doi:10.5281/zenodo.19235970."
